<div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Master</div><h1>Implantação de bases</h1><p class="text-secondary mb-0">Importe clientes, serviços e profissionais de uma base AppBarber.</p></div></div><div class="alert alert-warning"><strong>Faça um backup antes.</strong> A importação acrescenta dados ao cliente escolhido e fica auditada.</div><div class="card mb-4"><div class="card-body"><form method="post" action="/master/imports" enctype="multipart/form-data"><?=\App\Core\CSRF::field()?><div class="row g-3 align-items-end"><div class="col-md-5"><label class="form-label">Cliente de destino</label><select class="form-select" name="tenant_id" required><option value="">Selecione</option><?php foreach($tenants as $t):?><option value="<?=(int)$t['id']?>"><?=htmlspecialchars($t['name'])?></option><?php endforeach;?></select></div><div class="col-md-5"><label class="form-label">Backup AppBarber</label><input class="form-control" type="file" name="backup" accept=".json,.zip" required><div class="form-text">JSON appbarber-export-v1 ou ZIP contendo appbarber-export.json, até 20 MB.</div></div><div class="col-md-2"><button class="btn btn-primary w-100">Importar</button></div></div></form></div></div><div class="card"><div class="card-header"><strong>Histórico</strong></div><div class="table-responsive"><table class="table mb-0"><thead><tr><th>Data</th><th>Cliente</th><th>Arquivo</th><th>Status</th><th>Resumo</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($jobs as $j):?><tr><td><?=htmlspecialchars($j['created_at'])?></td><td><?=htmlspecialchars($j['tenant_name'])?></td><td><?=htmlspecialchars($j['original_name'])?></td><td><?=htmlspecialchars($j['status'])?></td><td><?=htmlspecialchars($j['summary_json']?:$j['error_message']?:'—')?></td></tr><?php endforeach;?></tbody></table></div></div>
